Finally, after losing many promising wizards, I ascended one. This is
also my first wishless ascension. A wishless conduct was much easier
than I thought (spell of poly was really nice), but it took some time.
I guess this is my longest game yet. This was also first time when I
achieved 30th experience level, I have never ascended with this high
AC (Valk with AC-33 was the worst before this) and I broke the quest
curse. Before this, all characters who have tried to do the quest
before the castle have died a horrible dead, sooner or later
(self-genocide is my favorite). This one survived.

The beginning was easy. I found two wands of poly and altar, poly'ed
my spellbooks, and got a few good spells including identify (this was
fun until I started to forget the spells), a magic harp and Magicbane
before level 5. Got bag in soko, and mines were not a problem. Until
the quest the game was easy. I sac'ed a lot Anhur gave me magnificent
gifts like the +0 Werebane. Gee thanks for nothing. I went to the
quest with my +2 Magicbane. My equipment wasn't very good, but I had a
wand of death with one charge. I ate all tengus, got teleportisis but
no control. When I achieved the final level I was sure that I will
die. The quest curse, crappy equipment and teleportisis without
control. At anytime I could have been teleported to same room with
Dark One, and I really wasn't ready to fight with him.

I had one chance. If I could zap him with a wand of death before he
wakes and grabs the amulet. First I had to get rid off the door
without waking him. I guessed kicking door or shooting it with force
bolt would wake him, so I tried wand of digging. It worked. Then I
readed scroll of earth and hid behind the rock. I pushed the rock next
to Dark One and zapped the wand with the last charge... And hit! That
feeling was almost compareable to first ascension. Never thought I
could make it, but I did it.

After the quest I sac'ed some more and finally got a Stormbringer. A
Frostbrand would be nicer, but this was way better than a MB. I raided
the ludios and gave al the gold to mine town priest. The rest was a
piece of cake. The Castle, Gehennom, back to main dungeon to relearn
spells and have sex and nurse-dance and almost die when got surrounded
by monsters when being naked and too hungry to teleport and all food
left in BoH which was left behind to be able to teleport and sac the
corpse and praying at wrong time trying to satisfy the hunger and
pissing off the god and losing all the protection (and the only priest
was the mine town one, which already had all my gold), more sex, Vlad
the Wimp, Rodney fingered and High Priest of Moloch also fingered. On
the way up I met an archon. I have had one pet and have seen one in
the plane of fire, but I had never fought with one before, so I
decided to try it out. These are not nice! I tried to kill it with
force bolt, but then I got pissed off and went to head to head and
kicked its ass.

The end game was easiest one I have ever done. In earth and fire the
portal was very close. Air was hardest one but still easy, because of
wands and spell of teleport. Water was piece of cake too. In Astral
Death and an Archon was right. Not going there! I took left one and
Pestilence. Zapped Pest with wand of death few times and teleported
the baddies. Near the altar was annoying Titan who summoned some
friends and ate some ray of death. Altar was a right one. I blew in my
magic whistle to teleport my guardian angel next to me and sacrificed
the amulet once again...

Altough the end game was REALLY easy, for some reason, this felt much
better than few last times.

